    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) This section applies if:  (a) an infringement notice for an alleged contravention of section 55B is issued to a person; and  (b) the person pays the penalty specified in the infringement notice within the infringement notice compliance period and in accordance with the notice; and  (c) the infringement notice is not withdrawn under section 55N.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(1) This section applies if:  (a) an infringement notice for an alleged contravention of section 55B is issued to a person; and  (b) the person pays the penalty specified in the infringement notice within the infringement notice compliance period and in accordance with the notice; and  (c) the infringement notice is not withdrawn under section 55N.";
